        "relationships": [
          "Resolve the transaction first by its permitted list and detail. Only use an applicationId explicitly present in its complete applicationItems property; multiple linked applications need separate disambiguated evidence, never the first arbitrary row.",
          "The related GET must echo the same applicationId. The endpoint returns the most recently created ServiceApplicationPayment for this application. This is the linked application stored quote, not an immutable transaction-line snapshot. Compare amounts and identify this provenance explicitly; a differing total or version remains unconfirmed.",
          "Additional surcharge/VAT entries do not automatically increase the service-fee total. Distinguish quoted service amount from channel fee allocations; reconcile actual recorded totals before claiming an inclusive amount.",
          "Do not output card information, account details, internal routing codes or raw calculation expressions. Public fee descriptions, rate, quantity, currency and version are sufficient."
